  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "HOME HIGHLIGHTS<br>-Unobstructed Gulf Views<br>-Steps to Beach Walkover<br>-Private Pool (Pool can be heated for an additional $50 per day between Oct 1 - May 1)<br>- Complimentary beach setups include 2 chairs and 1 umbrella - Service provided Mar 1-Oct 31<br>-Elevator<br>-Six Seater Golf Cart<br>-Six Adult Bikes<br><br>Nestled in the serene beauty of Inlet Beach, just a stone’s throw away from the emerald waters and sugar-soft sands of the Gulf of Mexico, Emerald View stands as a brand-new masterpiece of modern luxury. This exquisite residence offers an unrivaled experience of coastal living, where every detail has been meticulously crafted to provide an unparalleled level of comfort and elegance.<br>Upon entering this magnificent home, you’ll be greeted by spacious living areas adorned with vaulted ceilings and bathed in natural light that pours in through floor-to-ceiling impact windows. The design seamlessly blends the coastal ambiance with warm, natural wood tones, creating a harmonious and inviting atmosphere.<br>With seven generously sized bedrooms and twelve bathrooms, Emerald View is perfect for hosting family gatherings or luxurious getaways with friends. The thoughtfully designed layout ensures that each guest enjoys privacy and comfort.<br>The heart of this home is the open space living, dining, and kitchen area. The living room, with its plush seating and bespoke fixtures and modern fireplace offers a seamless blend of comfort and style. Large windows frame the breathtaking Gulf views, allowing you to feel at one with the sea from the comfort of your own home. The gourmet kitchen boasting top-of-the-line appliances provides a perfect space for culinary adventures. From here, you can step out onto the covered decks on each of the three upper levels. These vantage points offer unobstructed views of the Gulf of Mexico, where you can savor the gentle sea breezes and soak in the beauty of the coastal landscape.<br>But that’s not all – Emerald View comes with a host of exclusive amenities, including access to the beach via a convenient walkover, a sun-kissed private pool with a sun deck (heated during the cooler months for an additional fee), and even a six-seater golf cart and adult bikes to explore the surrounding area.<br>To further enhance your outdoor living experience, Emerald View boasts a state-of-the-art outdoor kitchen and dining area. Here, you can indulge in al fresco dining while taking in the breathtaking views of the Gulf. Whether you’re grilling up your favorite seafood or enjoying a leisurely meal under the coastal sky, this outdoor space adds an extra layer of luxury to your stay.<br>As you ascend through this multi-level paradise, you’ll find comfortable and luxurious sleeping quarters on each floor, ensuring that every guest has a retreat of their own. The crowning jewel is the fourth level, where you’ll discover a spacious family room and master king bedroom with a private ensuite featuring a spa shower and soaker tub.<br>Experience coastal living at its finest at Emerald View. Here, you’ll find not only a luxurious escape but also a connection to the natural beauty of the Gulf of Mexico. Whether you’re seeking a tranquil retreat or a space to entertain, this home is a testament to modern luxury and coastal elegance. Your Emerald Coast dream awaits.<br><br>SLEEPING ARRANGEMENTS<br>First Floor<br>Queen Bedroom w/ Shared Bathroom w/ Shower Only<br><br>Second Floor<br>Master King Bedroom w/ Private Bathroom, separate Shower/Tub<br>King Bedroom w/ Private Bathroom, Shower Only<br>Bunk Room, 3 Twin over Twin w/ Private Bathroom, Shower Only<br>Half Bath<br><br>Third Floor<br>King Bedroom w/ Private Bathroom, Shower Only<br>Half Bath<br><br>Fourth Floor<br>Master King Bedroom w/ Private Bathroom, separate Shower/Tub<br>Queen Bedroom w/ Private Bathroom, Shower Only<br>Half Bath",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
